    "sections": {
        "description": "MagShow is a responsive magazine-grid WordPress theme for news, blogs, photography, and gallery sites. It includes a featured-post slider, two-column post grid, block patterns and block styles, theme.json design presets, WooCommerce support, 16 widget areas, two menus, sticky navigation and sidebar options, wide-alignment and full-width templates, 60+ social links, and RTL support. MagShow PRO adds advanced design controls, more layouts, templates, grids, sliders, widgets, and infinite scrolling. Free version demo: https://demo.themesdna.com/magshow/"
    },
